- title: Implement unified logical-sequence projection
- difficulty_1_to_5: 3
- description: Implement one Triton projection over a virtual row space of B*(T+I), select the text or image base pointer for each row, and store directly into the matching output without creating concatenated or processed intermediates.
- rationale: This preserves a single GEMM-shaped launch, eliminates all explicit concatenate and split traffic, and exposes the largest combined M dimension for scheduling.

